==Quest Start==

Talk to Strandar Pinemist in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'hail Strandar Pinemist'
:''Strandar Pinemist says 'Greetings, young one. Are you a [child of the trees]? ''
You say, 'I am a child of the trees'
:''Strandar Pinemist says 'Then you are welcome in my presence. I shall call forth some loyal children if you but speak the name. Will or Fenalla will serve you well. ''

= Will Treewalker =

You say, 'I choose Will'
:''Strandar Pinemist says 'Please read this tome. It will explain how Will Treewalker is able to assist. When you are finished, please return it to me. We have but a single copy of such a tome, for which a tree gave its life.'' 
:''Strandar Pinemist says 'Welcome, Will Treewalker. ''
:''Will Treewalker says 'I am Will and I am here to serve. ''
:''Strandar Pinemist says 'I am no longer needed and will take my leave. ''
You say, 'hail Will Treewalker'
:''Will Treewalker says 'Children of the trees, friend and protector of nature. We are brothers and sisters to the wolves and bears. The call of the Great Pine has filled your soul and you have found your way here to be tested. Are you ready to be tested? ''
You say, 'I am ready to be tested'
:''Will Treewalker says 'The tests of old are difficult and dangerous, but the rewards for perseverance are great. I hold rewards for three tests. The test of the wolf, the test of the bear and the test of the tree. ''

== Druid Test of Wolf ==

Will Treewalker says 'So you wish to take the test of the wolf, do you? Go forth unto the islands and find an azure tessera, black face paint, and a worn leather mask.  Bring them back to me, but not until you have all three, and you shall be rewarded. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Drake-Hide Mask}}

